<title>USA: Kelley Oil &amp; Gas sets $125 mln 144a debt.</title>
<headline>Kelley Oil &amp; Gas sets $125 mln 144a debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following rule 144a private placement debt issue from Kelley Oil &amp; Gas Corp was priced on Friday, according to a high-yield market source.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc is lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER KELLEY OIL &amp; GAS CORP</p>
<p>AMT $125 MLN	  COUPON 10.375     MATURITY 10/15/06</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES  ISS PRICE 99.75   FIRST PAY DATE 4/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY B3	 YIELD 10.41 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS    SPREAD 388 BP     CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES THREE YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 35 PCT AT PAR PLUS COUPON --U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
